Package: QuasiEx
Type: Package
Title: Simple Analysis of Quasi-Experimental Pretest-Posttest Designs
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Jose", "Ventura-Leon", email = "jventuraleon@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-2996-4244"))
Description: A small set of functions, one per step of the analysis, for
    quasi-experimental studies with a non-equivalent control group and
    pretest and posttest measures. It prepares the raw data (eligibility
    criteria, participant flow, scores), describes baseline equivalence with
    standardized mean differences, estimates reliability, within-group change,
    the program effect through hierarchical regression (ANCOVA) with
    covariates and bootstrap intervals, model assumptions, clinically
    significant change and sensitivity analyses. Every result prints a table
    and a plain-language reading of its key values.
